{
  "schema": "shengyue-previews-1",
  "items": {
    "preset:Vivian": {
      "file": "Vivian.mp3",
      "text": "沿着这条小巷往前走，拐角是一家刚开门的面包店。窗边那只晒太阳的小猫，一听见纸袋响，就竖起了耳朵。",
      "duration": 10.8,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "69ab54ca60890d1e5f16d20636a50849e30f7c6c8358d0816f23788ebad5234d",
      "sha256": "cb95bce2951c61a0422f54cefa30c4f5d0a9ddb5cdb7f473a44c74e913e977ef"
    },
    "preset:Serena": {
      "file": "Serena.mp3",
      "text": "小兔子把最后一颗星星放进了口袋，轻轻关上窗。森林安静下来，只有月亮还守在树梢，陪着大家慢慢入睡。",
      "duration": 17.44,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "c6e561f543fc32041c85af95ea9e3efdb5dace43dbaacf202128c87a5a0dd764",
      "sha256": "c5a1b9ce6c9f06e49a2211e34089094d42e7cbfb171f21a44c3c42bf54ef392a"
    },
    "preset:Uncle_Fu": {
      "file": "Uncle_Fu.mp3",
      "text": "老屋的门推开时，铰链发出熟悉的轻响。父亲还坐在窗边，手里的那本书，停在我离开时的那一页。",
      "duration": 13.6,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "36af719f682a8485ab9570337365d723fb33dbf3d4bbd4165d8116fe021003dd",
      "sha256": "c23bf26f8943d37aba5d3749bbfa94e33e410eedb8f073ba35969c0cf70c0c6b"
    },
    "preset:Dylan": {
      "file": "Dylan.mp3",
      "text": "这家藏在胡同里的小面馆，拢共就六张桌子。面一端上来，先拌匀了再吃，芝麻酱的香味一下就出来了。",
      "duration": 9.44,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "2c82f1210512fa8f2770779edbb36fc21c16ae1fae151f84cf2415698fac79b5",
      "sha256": "01ef4ed7899a75a032c387d0f49700810955d8d9de20f5c1063878217ceba7b8"
    },
    "preset:Eric": {
      "file": "Eric.mp3",
      "text": "面条煮好以后，加一勺辣椒油，再撒点葱花。喜欢吃酸的，可以放一点醋，拌匀了就能开吃。",
      "duration": 9.92,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "ecece663df1af7489bbd2315745d223609dad992977eaca15c6647ef9a1bf66a",
      "sha256": "e5ada9af2f6635b0151564d0dbce7f775c1dbe23a17eaf28aa3f7354f2b4d009"
    },
    "preset:Ryan": {
      "file": "Ryan.mp3",
      "text": "The last train had already left when he reached the station. Under the clock, a small brown suitcase waited all alone.",
      "duration": 7.04,
      "language": "English",
      "fingerprint": "52a444d14bedf8d910705bfba765ae9d97953da8135988f4d911248d01f9f1aa",
      "sha256": "092ff80007db9992c81145011f32c9d728892ebd7be9d2f450d72a477413f993"
    },
    "preset:Aiden": {
      "file": "Aiden.mp3",
      "text": "Could you tell me how to get to the library? Go straight ahead, then turn left at the next street.",
      "duration": 5.04,
      "language": "English",
      "fingerprint": "c3776bb7ead80a50d563c59d54ccf13fc68d1dd4656477ea52451d50a088b926",
      "sha256": "e0d575c59012bebd72d9ec3a326ee29a112f7e9f2cb2b3c97cd754583a781f2a"
    },
    "preset:Ono_Anna": {
      "file": "Ono_Anna.mp3",
      "text": "古い本を開くと、小さな地図が落ちてきました。地図の端には、まだ誰も知らない村の名前が書かれていました。",
      "duration": 9.84,
      "language": "Japanese",
      "fingerprint": "66b0e749564e8f46c25c87a5b9542943f7a9b5e018516222d567f305a7860901",
      "sha256": "6dc2816cf86ab68bd90216e69a4a359c8f8584fa85de81116d4588a226735cd4"
    },
    "preset:Sohee": {
      "file": "Sohee.mp3",
      "text": "작은 토끼는 창문을 열고 밤하늘의 별을 바라봤어요. 가장 밝은 별을 보며 소원을 빈 뒤, 포근한 이불 속으로 들어갔어요.",
      "duration": 14.88,
      "language": "Korean",
      "fingerprint": "ec376b794e4c4ffbdf54cfd244edeec9d1a49970443ee5b9c7f3877477b60506",
      "sha256": "80e52fa51165145ff8e3b4cd0ba06e839700f6e15b4284f336b5fd7145e932a3"
    },
    "design:grandpa": {
      "file": "grandpa.mp3",
      "text": "那时候，村口还没有这座桥。每到放学，孩子们就挽起裤脚，踩着河里的石头，一步一步走回家。",
      "duration": 8.5,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "641665a309166ffc316b4db542516e763ee2743d5a39e7381766487ff8349d98",
      "sha256": "af1e6871a25cf2e168062ea81ddf61d6ac7944555d68e09b1b5aed8e5a82997a"
    },
    "design:grandma": {
      "file": "grandma.mp3",
      "text": "小熊把被角掖好，给身边的小兔子留了半个枕头。窗外落起细细的雨，两个好朋友挨在一起，很快就睡着了。",
      "duration": 11.28,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "dd0d04628b22c9f5ba65129a5882a2773f6a08390111dcbb047d24b54f80b05f",
      "sha256": "f29ab0f0631f74b8b2e6fcfe5a8277777d13bfd599a9c2611fae14ac93bb0315"
    },
    "design:story-male": {
      "file": "story-male.mp3",
      "text": "他在旧书里发现了一张没有署名的地图。地图的尽头，是一座从未在旅途中听说过的小镇。",
      "duration": 7.6,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "d4e826f436a52377cafeaf0482755ffbf4c1bd81f05230bf34e9a5e13bca8d41",
      "sha256": "3ae342c366e69f74a9c0a7785c44dad62bc391e9d3da7ac7743c24feca3a1d18"
    },
    "design:story-female": {
      "file": "story-female.mp3",
      "text": "她推开窗，院子里的栀子花已经开了。风翻动桌上的信纸，那句没来得及说出口的话，终于有了回音。",
      "duration": 10.21,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "1d3cc69d78824fb383e0b9d7bdabcb328638b7af549551cf5f4396eb45ca59a3",
      "sha256": "047837c830703c446973cd4831212e42abb3094a5e48846af56d31db2007f04f"
    },
    "design:hero": {
      "file": "hero.mp3",
      "text": "城门撑不了多久了。你带大家从北边的小路撤离，我留下来守住这里，天亮以后在山口会合。",
      "duration": 8.61,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "71020e4b6c8b889a8561a12657af078b460df7a8e81be488a1493012d0ba55c2",
      "sha256": "43ba7936e139555f04f9abcc3a231fd3ffcce142db695496938701f3934cb278"
    },
    "design:heroine": {
      "file": "heroine.mp3",
      "text": "等等，墙上的符号和地图对上了。先别碰那块石板，让我看看机关连在哪里，我们一定能找到出口。",
      "duration": 9.2,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "e79e19417df9ab6454647ea8cbdcf2bd40f07f232432e65274afbed2b990e4c1",
      "sha256": "d9f11f23a63c39a9a1ecfc71c984ca1508ae8600a08ad837b1036b7d3986bc54"
    },
    "design:mascot": {
      "file": "mascot.mp3",
      "text": "找到啦！最后一颗星星藏在蘑菇后面。快把它放进小篮子，我们就能打开通往糖果森林的大门啦！",
      "duration": 9.15,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "25b6d0b5955a5173f6e334ca23c0ecbacb6cdbf193f0889b72bf23c363fec44e",
      "sha256": "5ae254d628a7aed32fce52cc9b9c5bec92f255f4368efa1d75e81028cc90f5d4"
    },
    "design:robot": {
      "file": "robot.mp3",
      "text": "路线已更新。前方路口向右转，沿走廊直行二十米，您要找的会议室就在左手边。",
      "duration": 8.72,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "9107c8b8b575e185b5a36c61950fa612c17c33774799b52f1649bd60164a5d19",
      "sha256": "2468a776cf0897eb9041272ea72eb3d80e0244105dc6328798da5c4fef9b82c2"
    },
    "design:teacher-female": {
      "file": "teacher-female.mp3",
      "text": "把一个苹果平均分成四份，每一份就是四分之一。拿走其中的两份，也就是四分之二，正好等于二分之一。",
      "duration": 11.44,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "f3f7c9b3f40eaa5ad92d0ec0caea26a771fe12fbf9aaabcc177aa6c426ebe216",
      "sha256": "eefa5946792782df3fc7e4da6e16279ac5f349a8cc2a226cc70fa0d92b3e8702"
    },
    "design:teacher-male": {
      "file": "teacher-male.mp3",
      "text": "水受热后会变成水蒸气，这个过程叫作汽化。烧水时，壶口冒出的白雾，其实是水蒸气遇冷形成的小水滴。",
      "duration": 13.16,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "8939c200d14b70aad248c364816516a71cb9a760b5610cefaa146bc3e9bc57de",
      "sha256": "92b217c2ceeb79fda71202b90ea7a05a526e7a625492f1d7e019dda609283b03"
    },
    "design:training-female": {
      "file": "training-female.mp3",
      "text": "收到新任务后，先在协作表中写清负责人和完成时间。如果进度受阻，请把具体问题记录下来，并及时告诉项目负责人。",
      "duration": 10.45,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "44f7f6d8c38aa8ec5059c635bd075bb2acaf5783a8d01121bfaf2cb556534de6",
      "sha256": "0da5103b22f9644742ba5bd7730bec952ffba274f30d0825a7bce0ddd3e368ab"
    },
    "design:science-male": {
      "file": "science-male.mp3",
      "text": "为什么雨后容易看到彩虹？阳光进入小水滴时会发生折射，不同颜色的光偏转角度不同，于是分成了彩色的光带。",
      "duration": 11.52,
      "language": "Chinese",
      "fingerprint": "74cc9fc85f708a116cf89daa43cd25ee0c402d62a84722da9754732b29c68bd2",
      "sha256": "238fb19e8838657c10c6c6c47635ddc28a6a18bfcb7a345a17cdd9947a2015c4"
    },
    "design:tutorial-female": {
      "file": "tutorial-female.mp3",
      "text": "先打开设置，找到保存位置。确认文件夹后，点击完成，就可以继续下一步了。",
      "duration": 7.68,
      "language": "Chinese",
